WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.100
A customer calls while your team is busy.

2
00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:04.640
Another leaves an inquiry on your website.

3
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:06.520
Who takes the next step?

4
00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:11.140
Meet Grace, an AI receptionist connected
to GoHighLevel.

5
00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:16.160
Built for CozyHome, a home improvement
portfolio demo, Grace turns a

6
00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:18.480
conversation into a booked home survey.

7
00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:23.380
She asks about the customer's project,
checks available times, and collects

8
00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:24.480
their contact details.

9
00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:26.400
One question at a time.

10
00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:31.560
Once the caller confirms, Grace books the
survey and saves the details in go

11
00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:32.120
high level.

12
00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:36.340
The contact, the appointment, the next
step, all connected.

13
00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:37.700
Plans change?

14
00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:41.640
Grace can reschedule or cancel with the
customer's confirmation.

15
00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:45.460
She can also call back people who inquire
through the website.

16
00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:49.500
Less repetitive call handling, less manual
data entry,

17
00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:52.500
more time for your team to focus on
customers.

18
00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:55.460
Imagine that working for your business.

19
00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:59.900
Mark Automates, a little less admin, a lot
more you.
